id:155\nevent:response.output_text.done\n:HTTP_STATUS/200\ndata:{\"sequence_number\":154,\"content_index\":0,\"item_id\":\"msg_f660daae-c572-4023-b983-e7e324cccca3\",\"text\":\"## Summary: Alibaba Cloud Model Studio\\n\\n**Alibaba Cloud Model Studio** is a one-stop, enterprise-grade model service and AI application development platform. Key points from the official documentation:\\n\\n- **Model access**: Provides the full Qwen series plus mainstream third-party LLMs (e.g., DeepSeek, Kimi, GLM) through official Qwen APIs — no infrastructure to manage, with pay-as-you-go, on-demand usage.\\n- **Flagship tiers**: Qwen-Max (highest performance for complex multi-step tasks), Qwen-Plus (balanced performance/speed/cost, recommended for most scenarios), and Qwen-Flash (low-cost, low-latency for simple tasks).\\n- **Multimodal support**: Text generation, visual understanding, image generation, video generation (Wan series), speech recognition/synthesis, and embeddings.\\n- **OpenAI compatibility**: Drop-in migration for existing OpenAI code — just update the API key, base URL, and model name.\\n- **Domain-specific models**: For long-text processing, translation, data mining, intent recognition, role-playing, and deep research.\\n- **GenAI applications**: Includes AI-native tools such as QwenWork (productivity platform) and Qoder (AI coding assistant with enterprise deployment options).\\n\\n**Source**: https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/what-is-model-studio\\n\\nRelated official docs: [API Reference](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/model-api-reference/), [Supported Models Overview](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/models), and [Getting Started](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/get-started-with-models/).\",\"output_index\":5,\"type\":\"response.output_text.done\",\"logprobs\":[]}\n\nid:156\nevent:response.content_part.done\n:HTTP_STATUS/200\ndata:{\"sequence_number\":155,\"output_index\":5,\"type\":\"response.content_part.done\",\"content_index\":0,\"item_id\":\"msg_f660daae-c572-4023-b983-e7e324cccca3\",\"part\":{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"annotations\":[],\"text\":\"## Summary: Alibaba Cloud Model Studio\\n\\n**Alibaba Cloud Model Studio** is a one-stop, enterprise-grade model service and AI application development platform. Key points from the official documentation:\\n\\n- **Model access**: Provides the full Qwen series plus mainstream third-party LLMs (e.g., DeepSeek, Kimi, GLM) through official Qwen APIs — no infrastructure to manage, with pay-as-you-go, on-demand usage.\\n- **Flagship tiers**: Qwen-Max (highest performance for complex multi-step tasks), Qwen-Plus (balanced performance/speed/cost, recommended for most scenarios), and Qwen-Flash (low-cost, low-latency for simple tasks).\\n- **Multimodal support**: Text generation, visual understanding, image generation, video generation (Wan series), speech recognition/synthesis, and embeddings.\\n- **OpenAI compatibility**: Drop-in migration for existing OpenAI code — just update the API key, base URL, and model name.\\n- **Domain-specific models**: For long-text processing, translation, data mining, intent recognition, role-playing, and deep research.\\n- **GenAI applications**: Includes AI-native tools such as QwenWork (productivity platform) and Qoder (AI coding assistant with enterprise deployment options).\\n\\n**Source**: https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/what-is-model-studio\\n\\nRelated official docs: [API Reference](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/model-api-reference/), [Supported Models Overview](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/models), and [Getting Started](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/get-started-with-models/).\"}}\n\nid:157\nevent:response.output_item.done\n:HTTP_STATUS/200\ndata:{\"sequence_number\":156,\"item\":{\"id\":\"msg_f660daae-c572-4023-b983-e7e324cccca3\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"type\":\"message\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"annotations\":[],\"text\":\"## Summary: Alibaba Cloud Model Studio\\n\\n**Alibaba Cloud Model Studio** is a one-stop, enterprise-grade model service and AI application development platform. Key points from the official documentation:\\n\\n- **Model access**: Provides the full Qwen series plus mainstream third-party LLMs (e.g., DeepSeek, Kimi, GLM) through official Qwen APIs — no infrastructure to manage, with pay-as-you-go, on-demand usage.\\n- **Flagship tiers**: Qwen-Max (highest performance for complex multi-step tasks), Qwen-Plus (balanced performance/speed/cost, recommended for most scenarios), and Qwen-Flash (low-cost, low-latency for simple tasks).\\n- **Multimodal support**: Text generation, visual understanding, image generation, video generation (Wan series), speech recognition/synthesis, and embeddings.\\n- **OpenAI compatibility**: Drop-in migration for existing OpenAI code — just update the API key, base URL, and model name.\\n- **Domain-specific models**: For long-text processing, translation, data mining, intent recognition, role-playing, and deep research.\\n- **GenAI applications**: Includes AI-native tools such as QwenWork (productivity platform) and Qoder (AI coding assistant with enterprise deployment options).\\n\\n**Source**: https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/what-is-model-studio\\n\\nRelated official docs: [API Reference](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/model-api-reference/), [Supported Models Overview](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/models), and [Getting Started](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/get-started-with-models/).\"}],\"status\":\"completed\"},\"output_index\":5,\"type\":\"response.output_item.done\"}\n\nid:158\nevent:response.completed\n:HTTP_STATUS/200\ndata:{\"sequence_number\":157,\"type\":\"response.completed\",\"response\":{\"top_logprobs\":0,\"metadata\":{},\"presence_penalty\":0.0,\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"low\"},\"usage\":{\"input_token