dio\"},{\"type\":\"url\",\"url\":\"https://help.aliyun.com/en/model-studio/what-is-model-studio\"},{\"type\":\"url\",\"url\":\"https://www.gartner.com/reviews/product/alibaba-cloud-model-studio\"},{\"type\":\"url\",\"url\":\"https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/models\"},{\"type\":\"url\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gfqytnlfx2s\"},{\"type\":\"url\",\"url\":\"https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/rag-knowledge-base\"},{\"type\":\"url\",\"url\":\"https://www.alibabacloud.com/en?_p_lc=5\"}],\"type\":\"search\",\"queries\":[\"Alibaba Cloud Model Studio official documentation\",\"Model Studio Alibaba Cloud product overview\"],\"query\":\"Alibaba Cloud Model Studio official documentation\"},\"id\":\"msg_2a679543-848b-4eeb-aae9-654c735f7842\",\"type\":\"web_search_call\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"Use web_extractor to read the main \\\"What is Model Studio\\\" documentation page.\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"id\":\"msg_def4b034-285a-47a5-ab58-b97faed952eb\"},{\"output\":\"The useful information in https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/what-is-model-studio for user goal Summarize what Alibaba Cloud Model Studio is, its key features, capabilities, and main use cases as follows: \\n\\nEvidence in page: \\n### Models\\n\\nEmpowering AI innovation for both enterprises and developers with Alibaba Cloud’s best-in-class Qwen models, AI-native apps, and AI solutions.\\n\\n**Alibaba Cloud Model Studio** \\nEnterprise-grade large model service and application development platform.\\n\\n#### Models\\n\\n**Qwen3.8-Flash** \\nFast multimodal model with 1M context, powering coding, agentic workflows, and visual analysis **HappyHorse-1.1-T2V** \\nCinematic creative generation, ultimate dynamic details **Qwen3.7-Plus** \\nNative multimodal, 1M context, agentic coding **Wan2.7-I2V** \\nCinematic I2V with emotional depth and visceral impact\\n\\n**Qwen3.8-Max** \\nComprehensive leap in coding and professional work, empowering complex reasoning tasks **Qwen3.7-Max** \\nVersatile agent foundation, long-horizon reasoning & cross-framework flexibility **Qwen-Image-3.0** \\nProfessional infographics, exquisite photorealism **Wan2.7-VideoEdit** \\nSupports both localized and global editing with prompt\\n\\n**Qwen3.7-Flash** \\nCost-efficient native vision-language model **DeepSeek-V4-Pro** \\nFlagship MoE model with 1M context, powering advanced reasoning, coding, and agentic workflows **Wan2.7-T2V** \\nHigh-fidelity T2V, 15s duration, advanced camera control\\n\\n**Wan3.0-I2V** \\nAll-in-one video model with 30s output, enabling reference, editing, replication, and driving **DeepSeek-v4-Flash** \\nCost-efficient model with enhanced agentic capabilities for diverse automation scenarios **Qwen3-VL-Plus** \\nNative VL, spatial reasoning, 1M-context video analysis\\n\\n#### GenAI Application\\n\\n**QwenWork** \\nAll-in-one AI productivity platform **Qoder** \\nIntelligent coding assistant, available for enterprise-dedicated deployment. **Qoder CN** \\nAI-powered coding assistant that boosts developer productivity with intelligent code completion, AI chat, multi-file editing, and task automation.\\n\\n## Alibaba Cloud Model Studio is a one-stop model service platform. It provides the full Qwen series and mainstream third-party LLMs through official Qwen APIs and OpenAI-compatible APIs, with multimodal support across text, image, and audio/video. Call models on demand — no infrastructure to manage.\\n\\nGenerate content and summaries with a few lines of code.\\n\\n> Model Studio is OpenAI-compatible. Update the API key, base URL, and model name to migrate existing OpenAI code.\\n\\n## Model service\\n\\nModel Studio provides ready-to-use model services, including the proprietary Qwen series and third-party models such as DeepSeek, Kimi, and GLM. See Recommended models.\\n\\n- **Qwen flagship models**:\\n  - Qwen-Max: The highest-performing model in the Qwen series, suited for complex, multi-step tasks.\\n  - Qwen-Plus: Balances performance, speed, and cost — **recommended** for most scenarios.\\n  - Qwen-Flash: Low-cost and low-latency — suited for simple tasks that require fast responses.\\n- **Multimodal coverage**: Includes text generation, visual understanding, image generation, video generation, speech recognition and synthesis, and embedding.\\n\\n- **Domain-specific models**: Models for long-text processing, translation, data mining, intent recognition, role-playing, and deep research.\\n\\nSummary: \\nAlibaba Cloud Model Studio is a one-stop, enterprise-grade model service platform that provides access to the Qwen series of models and other mainstream third-party LLMs like DeepSeek and GLM. Its key features include ready-to-use services, multimodal support for text, image, video, and audio, and OpenAI-compatible APIs for easy migration. The platform offers various capabilities, including text generation, visual understanding, image and video generation, speech recognition, and specialized models for tasks like long-text processing and data mining. Main use cases involve empowering developers with AI-native applications and solutions, supporting complex reasoning tasks, enabling coding assistance (e.g., Qoder), and serving as a comprehensive GenAI application platform (e.g., QwenWork).\",\"urls\":[\"https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/what-is-model-studio\"],\"goal\":\"Summarize what Alibaba Cloud Model Studio is, its key features, capabilities, and main use cases\",\"id\":\"msg_caad43f4-33a8-4e30-8138-50b01b9517d7\",\"type\":\"web_extractor_call\",\"status\":\"completed\"},{\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"Note: The extracted content mentions models such as Qwen3.8, DeepSeek-V4, and Wan3.0, and given that the current time is September 2026, that's plausible. I'll provide a concise summary with sources attached.\\n\"}],\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"id\":\"msg_85beb821-b52b-4a45-88d2-a7d43106e522\"},{\"id\":\"msg_f660daae-c572-4023-b983-e7e324cccca3\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"type\":\"message\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"annotations\":[],\"text\":\"## Summary: Alibaba Cloud Model Studio\\n\\n**Alibaba Cloud Model Studio** is a one-stop, enterprise-grade model service and AI application development platform. Key points from the official documentation:\\n\\n- **Model access**: Provides the full Qwen series plus mainstream third-party LLMs (e.g., DeepSeek, Kimi, GLM) through official Qwen APIs — no infrastructure to manage, with pay-as-you-go, on-demand usage.\\n- **Flagship tiers**: Qwen-Max (highest performance for complex multi-step tasks), Qwen-Plus (balanced performance/speed/cost, recommended for most scenarios), and Qwen-Flash (low-cost, low-latency for simple tasks).\\n- **Multimodal support**: Text generation, visual understanding, image generation, video generation (Wan series), speech recognition/synthesis, and embeddings.\\n- **OpenAI compatibility**: Drop-in migration for existing OpenAI code — just update the API key, base URL, and model name.\\n- **Domain-specific models**: For long-text processing, translation, data mining, intent recognition, role-playing, and deep research.\\n- **GenAI applications**: Includes AI-native tools such as QwenWork (productivity platform) and Qoder (AI coding assistant with enterprise deployment options).\\n\\n**Source**: https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/what-is-model-studio\\n\\nRelated official docs: [API Reference](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/model-api-reference/), [Supported Models Overview](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/models), and [Getting Started](https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/get-started-with-models/).\"}],\"status\":\"completed\"}],\"top_p\":1.0,\"completed_at\":1789446257,\"frequency_penalty\":0.0,\"parallel_tool_calls\":true,\"background\":false,\"temperature\":1.0,\"tool_choice\":\"auto\",\"model\":\"qwen3